1
00:00:01,990 --> 00:00:05,120
Open Settings with the gear icon.

2
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:08,330
Go to the Trading section.

3
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:13,190
Default Orders Distance sets how far from the price your stop, limit and entry orders start.

4
00:00:13,290 --> 00:00:17,520
Click Configure.

5
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:21,990
Min. Distance is your broker's minimum for each instrument.

6
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:26,350
Grey values follow that minimum. Your own values show in bold.

7
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:30,250
Search to find an instrument.

8
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:33,720
Click a value to change it. Here, the stop distance.

9
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:38,700
Type the distance in pips.

10
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:43,060
Now every new EURUSD stop starts 10 pips from the price.

11
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:48,090
Reset all distances to go back to your broker's minimums.

